          "verify_note": "VERIFY"
        },
        {
          "id": "bite_dog_s2",
          "order": 2,
          "text": {
            "en": "Wash the wound right away with plenty of running water and soap for about 15 minutes.",
            "hi": "घाव को तुरंत बहते पानी और साबुन से लगभग 15 मिनट तक अच्छी तरह धोएँ।",
            "hinglish": "",
            "mr": ""
          },
          "source": {
            "doc": "G1",
            "page": 323,
